*> DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA swaps . and , in pictures and numbers, and
*> CURRENCY SIGN IS "W" makes W the currency symbol.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EUROS.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SPECIAL-NAMES.
    CURRENCY SIGN IS "W"
    DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  AMOUNT          PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 1234567,89.
01  AMOUNT-OUT      PIC 9.999.999,99.
01  PRICE-OUT       PIC WWW.WW9,99.
01  COUNTS          PIC X(0020).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE AMOUNT TO AMOUNT-OUT PRICE-OUT
    DISPLAY AMOUNT-OUT PRICE-OUT COUNTS
    STOP RUN.
